# Claude Code: per-developer settings only. .claude/settings.json is shared
# project config and stays tracked if it is ever added. This was previously
# covered only by a personal global ignore file, which does not apply on the
# Pi, in CI, or for anyone else who clones.
.claude/settings.local.json
